        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **Filmic Split**: Fourteen hand-tuned split-tone presets including Velvet Negative, Cinema Stock, Amber Print, and Tokyo Print, with film saturation and push and pull controls.\n• **Color Luminance**: Brighten or darken red, green, blue, cyan, magenta, and yellow independently to lift skies, deepen reds, or recover skin tones."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101408d90",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028b340",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "• **Film Filters Tab**: A new dedicated tab brings all film-inspired filters together in one place for faster editing.\n• **Chromatic Aberration**: Add customizable color fringing to create vintage lens character or stylized looks.\n• **Lens Distortion**: Apply barrel or pincushion distortion to mimic real-world lens behavior.\n• **Technicolor 3-Strip**: Recreate the iconic classic-cinema color separation for rich, bold results.\n• **Film Saturation**: Fine-tune saturation with a film-like response for natural, pleasing color shifts."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x101409a10",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028b910",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
        "text": "  • **Batch Editing**: The new batch editing feature allows you to select and edit multiple photos and videos at once.\n  • **Enhanced Grain Filter**: Achieve a more cinematic finish with enhanced grain effects."
      },
      {
        "address": "0x10140a7a0",
        "references": [
          {
            "from": "0x10028c368",
            "function": "sub_10028aaa0"
          }
        ],
        "section": "__cstring",
